      "author": {
        "id": 1882526
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-12-22T12:29:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Then it would be cleaner to start by creating a `\u0026mut [u8]` wrapping that memory and use it throughout (e.g. replace `num_bytes` with `buffer.len()`).",
      "range": {
